records followed by one overall summary row.

The overall row can be used to reconcile:

Total Responsibility - Total Collected
= Outstanding Balance

The overall collection rate is calculated using
total collected dollars divided by total patient
responsibility, rather than averaging individual
patient collection rates.

Because claims and payments are aggregated before
the LEFT JOIN, multiple payments cannot duplicate
claim billed amounts or patient responsibility.

The prior validation checks also confirmed:

